    {
      "source": "Configuration type to register filters customizing the HTTP methods supported. By default, filters registered are\napplied globally. Domain type specific filters can be registered via <a href=\"#forDomainType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>forDomainType(Class)</code></a>. Useful global\nshortcuts like <a href=\"#disablePutOnItemResources()\"><code>disablePutOnItemResources()</code></a> do exist as well.",
      "translation": "配置用于注册自定义 HTTP 方法支持的过滤器类型。默认情况下，注册的过滤器将全局应用。可通过<a href=\"#forDomainType(java.lang.Class)\"><code>forDomainType(Class)</code></a>注册特定于域类型的过滤器。此外，还存在一些有用的全局快捷方式，例如<a href=\"#disablePutOnItemResources()\"><code>disablePutOnItemResources()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
